            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "دشمن نتوانست وارد قلعه شود. Doshman natavânest vâred-e qal'e shavad. The enemy could not get into the castle."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Written with ع. Plural qal'e-hâ."
            }
          ]
        },
